{"path": "input/report.md", "anchor": "R1", "document_id": "D00001", "quote": "The total T7 charge is 120 credits. The ledger lists A as 60, B as 40 and C as 20 credits; adding those lines gives 120 credits.", "locator": {"kind": "text", "start_line": 4, "end_line": 4, "start_character": 38, "end_character": 166, "coordinate_unit": "Unicode code points after UTF-8 BOM removal", "original": "input/originals/D00001.md", "original_sha256": "8e78a2380ab307e5d79a43c6c3ecfe2a5866bf53f46190fe5b2195357b6b06c0", "artifact_directory": "extraction/D00001/attempt-6t7kxo61"}, "method": "utf8", "uncertainty": []}
{"path": "input/report.md", "anchor": "R2", "document_id": "D00001", "quote": "Charge A breaches the individual-charge cap. Policy P2 sets the cap at 50 credits, and the ledger records A as 60 credits.", "locator": {"kind": "text", "start_line": 7, "end_line": 7, "start_character": 184, "end_character": 306, "coordinate_unit": "Unicode code points after UTF-8 BOM removal", "original": "input/originals/D00001.md", "original_sha256": "8e78a2380ab307e5d79a43c6c3ecfe2a5866bf53f46190fe5b2195357b6b06c0", "artifact_directory": "extraction/D00001/attempt-6t7kxo61"}, "method": "utf8", "uncertainty": []}
{"path": "input/report.md", "anchor": "R3", "document_id": "D00001", "quote": "The physical receipt occurred at 16:40 local time on 4 November 2026. The physical receipt scan records that timestamp for T7.", "locator": {"kind": "text", "start_line": 10, "end_line": 10, "start_character": 324, "end_character": 450, "coordinate_unit": "Unicode code points after UTF-8 BOM removal", "original": "input/originals/D00001.md", "original_sha256": "8e78a2380ab307e5d79a43c6c3ecfe2a5866bf53f46190fe5b2195357b6b06c0", "artifact_directory": "extraction/D00001/attempt-6t7kxo61"}, "method": "utf8", "uncertainty": []}
{"path": "input/report.md", "anchor": "R4", "document_id": "D00001", "quote": "The physical receipt missed the policy P3 deadline. Policy P3 sets the receipt deadline at 16:30; the receipt scan records 16:40.", "locator": {"kind": "text", "start_line": 13, "end_line": 13, "start_character": 468, "end_character": 597, "coordinate_unit": "Unicode code points after UTF-8 BOM removal", "original": "input/originals/D00001.md", "original_sha256": "8e78a2380ab307e5d79a43c6c3ecfe2a5866bf53f46190fe5b2195357b6b06c0", "artifact_directory": "extraction/D00001/attempt-6t7kxo61"}, "method": "utf8", "uncertainty": []}
{"path": "input/report.md", "anchor": "R5", "document_id": "D00001", "quote": "The supplied records do not establish T7 release eligibility. Policy P4 requires quality and security approvals; the ledger records quality approval but supplies no security status, and the receipt records arrival only. This does not establish that security approval never occurred.", "locator": {"kind": "text", "start_line": 16, "end_line": 16, "start_character": 615, "end_character": 897, "coordinate_unit": "Unicode code points after UTF-8 BOM removal", "original": "input/originals/D00001.md", "original_sha256": "8e78a2380ab307e5d79a43c6c3ecfe2a5866bf53f46190fe5b2195357b6b06c0", "artifact_directory": "extraction/D00001/attempt-6t7kxo61"}, "method": "utf8", "uncertainty": []}
{"path": "input/report.md", "anchor": "R6", "document_id": "D00001", "quote": "Charge B is 40 credits.", "locator": {"kind": "text", "start_line": 19, "end_line": 19, "start_character": 915, "end_character": 938, "coordinate_unit": "Unicode code points after UTF-8 BOM removal", "original": "input/originals/D00001.md", "original_sha256": "8e78a2380ab307e5d79a43c6c3ecfe2a5866bf53f46190fe5b2195357b6b06c0", "artifact_directory": "extraction/D00001/attempt-6t7kxo61"}, "method": "utf8", "uncertainty": []}
{"path": "input/report.md", "anchor": "R7", "document_id": "D00001", "quote": "The supplied package provides no grading criterion for calling the handover exemplary. Policy P5 expressly states that no such definition or scale is supplied; no exemplary grade is inferred.", "locator": {"kind": "text", "start_line": 22, "end_line": 22, "start_character": 956, "end_character": 1147, "coordinate_unit": "Unicode code points after UTF-8 BOM removal", "original": "input/originals/D00001.md", "original_sha256": "8e78a2380ab307e5d79a43c6c3ecfe2a5866bf53f46190fe5b2195357b6b06c0", "artifact_directory": "extraction/D00001/attempt-6t7kxo61"}, "method": "utf8", "uncertainty": []}
{"path": "input/report.md", "anchor": "document-preamble", "document_id": "D00001", "quote": "# T7 transfer review", "locator": {"kind": "text", "start_line": 1, "end_line": 1, "start_character": 0, "end_character": 20, "coordinate_unit": "Unicode code points after UTF-8 BOM removal", "original": "input/originals/D00001.md", "original_sha256": "8e78a2380ab307e5d79a43c6c3ecfe2a5866bf53f46190fe5b2195357b6b06c0", "artifact_directory": "extraction/D00001/attempt-6t7kxo61"}, "method": "utf8", "uncertainty": []}
{"path": "input/sources/01-policy.docx.md", "anchor": "docx-p-0001", "document_id": "D00002", "quote": "Cedar laboratory transfer policy P1. Effective 4 November 2026. All entities and events are synthetic.", "locator": {"kind": "docx", "member": "word/document.xml", "xml_path": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[1]", "paragraph_index_in_story": 1, "story": "document", "raw_xml_artifact": "docx-xml/document.xml", "footnote_ids": [], "endnote_ids": [], "comment_ids": [], "original": "input/originals/D00002.docx", "original_sha256": "4a0cf796e8b3917bc1606f856a688d36c5d1aac4d82a6aba8e1576be91be5c42", "artifact_directory": "extraction/D00002/attempt-szo9jrmh"}, "method": "docx-xml", "uncertainty": []}
{"path": "input/sources/01-policy.docx.md", "anchor": "docx-p-0002", "document_id": "D00002", "quote": "P1: For transfer T7 on 4 November 2026, count the three ledger charges A, B and C once each, in whole credits. No tax, discount or currency conversion applies. A revised ledger explicitly supersedes the prior ledger for this transfer.", "locator": {"kind": "docx", "member": "word/document.xml", "xml_path": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[2]", "paragraph_index_in_story": 2, "story": "document", "raw_xml_artifact": "docx-xml/document.xml", "footnote_ids": [], "endnote_ids": [], "comment_ids": [], "original": "input/originals/D00002.docx", "original_sha256": "4a0cf796e8b3917bc1606f856a688d36c5d1aac4d82a6aba8e1576be91be5c42", "artifact_directory": "extraction/D00002/attempt-szo9jrmh"}, "method": "docx-xml", "uncertainty": []}
{"path": "input/sources/01-policy.docx.md", "anchor": "docx-p-0003", "document_id": "D00002", "quote": "P2: Each individual charge must be at most 50 credits. A charge above 50 breaches the individual-charge cap; aggregate totals do not replace this test.", "locator": {"kind": "docx", "member": "word/document.xml", "xml_path": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[3]", "paragraph_index_in_story": 3, "story": "document", "raw_xml_artifact": "docx-xml/document.xml", "footnote_ids": [], "endnote_ids": [], "comment_ids": [], "original": "input/originals/D00002.docx", "original_sha256": "4a0cf796e8b3917bc1606f856a688d36c5d1aac4d82a6aba8e1576be91be5c42", "artifact_directory": "extraction/D00002/attempt-szo9jrmh"}, "method": "docx-xml", "uncertainty": []}
{"path": "input/sources/01-policy.docx.md", "anchor": "docx-p-0004", "document_id": "D00002", "quote": "P3: T7 receipt is timely if the physical receipt timestamp is no later than 16:30 local time on 4 November 2026. No grace period applies. Dispatch time is irrelevant.", "locator": {"kind": "docx", "member": "word/document.xml", "xml_path": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[4]", "paragraph_index_in_story": 4, "story": "document", "raw_xml_artifact": "docx-xml/document.xml", "footnote_ids": [], "endnote_ids": [], "comment_ids": [], "original": "input/originals/D00002.docx", "original_sha256": "4a0cf796e8b3917bc1606f856a688d36c5d1aac4d82a6aba8e1576be91be5c42", "artifact_directory": "extraction/D00002/attempt-szo9jrmh"}, "method": "docx-xml", "uncertainty": []}
{"path": "input/sources/01-policy.docx.md", "anchor": "docx-p-0005", "document_id": "D00002", "quote": "P4: T7 release eligibility requires both quality approval and security approval by 17:00 local time. Quality approval alone is insufficient. A missing security-status field is not a statement that no approval event occurred.", "locator": {"kind": "docx", "member": "word/document.xml", "xml_path": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[5]", "paragraph_index_in_story": 5, "story": "document", "raw_xml_artifact": "docx-xml/document.xml", "footnote_ids": [], "endnote_ids": [], "comment_ids": [], "original": "input/originals/D00002.docx", "original_sha256": "4a0cf796e8b3917bc1606f856a688d36c5d1aac4d82a6aba8e1576be91be5c42", "artifact_directory": "extraction/D00002/attempt-szo9jrmh"}, "method": "docx-xml", "uncertainty": []}
{"path": "input/sources/01-policy.docx.md", "anchor": "docx-p-0006", "document_id": "D00002", "quote": "P5: This package contains no definition or grading scale for the adjective exemplary. The package is complete only for charges A, B and C; it is not a complete approval-event history.", "locator": {"kind": "docx", "member": "word/document.xml", "xml_path": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[6]", "paragraph_index_in_story": 6, "story": "document", "raw_xml_artifact": "docx-xml/document.xml", "footnote_ids": [], "endnote_ids": [], "comment_ids": [], "original": "input/originals/D00002.docx", "original_sha256": "4a0cf796e8b3917bc1606f856a688d36c5d1aac4d82a6aba8e1576be91be5c42", "artifact_directory": "extraction/D00002/attempt-szo9jrmh"}, "method": "docx-xml", "uncertainty": []}
